2026-10-28T05:16:01.3021172Z # reporter that grades `main` is exempt from `## Red checks` only
2026-10-28T05:16:01.3021450Z # while the diff touches none of its inputs, and a delivery row the
2026-10-28T05:16:01.3021712Z # pull request ADDS (its own) is not one; a row it edits or deletes is.
